                      автоматически.</p>

                    <div class="mt-10 flex items-center gap-3">
                      <input id="calc-letters" type="text" maxlength="3" placeholder="AAA"
                        class="w-28 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-center font-mono text-lg uppercase text-neutral-900 outline-none transition-colors placeholder:text-neutral-300 focus:border-neutral-400"
                        autocomplete="off" />
                      <span class="text-neutral-300">-</span>
                      <input id="calc-digits" type="text" maxlength="3" placeholder="000"
                        class="w-28 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white px-4 py-3 text-center font-mono text-lg text-neutral-900 outline-none transition-colors placeholder:text-neutral-300 focus:border-neutral-400"
                        autocomplete="off" />
                      <button id="calc-generate-button" type="button"
                        class="interactive-btn inline-flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white text-neutral-700 transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-100 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-60"
                        title="Сгенерировать свободный UNQ (низкий/средний сегмент)" aria-label="Сгенерировать свободный UNQ">
                        <svg class="icon-stroke h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                          <path d="M21 12a9 9 0 1 1-2.64-6.36"></path>
                          <path d="M21 4v6h-6"></path>
                        </svg>
                      </button>
                    </div>

                    <p id="calc-preview" class="mt-3 font-mono text-sm text-neutral-400">unqx.uz/______</p>

                    <div id="calc-empty-state"
                      class="mt-8 hidden rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white/90 p-8 shadow-[0_10px_30px_rgba(15,23,42,0.05)]">
                      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
                        <span
                          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 px-3 py-1 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-neutral-500">
                          Предпросмотр цены
                        </span>
                        <span class="text-xs text-neutral-400">Введите 3 буквы + 3 цифры</span>
                      </div>
                      <p class="mt-5 font-mono text-2xl font-bold tracking-wider text-neutral-900">AAA000</p>
                      <div class="mt-4 flex items-end gap-2">
                        <span class="text-3xl font-bold text-neutral-900">100 000</span>
                        <span class="pb-1 text-sm text-neutral-400">сум от</span>
                      </div>
                      <p class="mt-2 text-xs text-neutral-400">Цена зависит от паттерна букв, цифр и flash-скидок.</p>
                      <div class="mt-4 grid gap-2 text-sm text-neutral-600 sm:grid-cols-2">
                        <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 px-3 py-2">Буквы: шаблон x1..x10</div>
                        <div class="rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 px-3 py-2">Цифры: шаблон x1..x6</div>
                      </div>
                    </div>

                    <div id="calc-result" class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 bg-white p-8">
                      <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                        <span id="calc-rarity-badge"
                          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full border px-3 py-1 font-mono text-[11px] font-medium tracking-wider">
                          <svg class="icon-stroke h-3 w-3" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                            <path d="m12 3 2.5 5.5L20 10l-4 4 .9 6L12 17l-4.9 3 .9-6-4-4 5.5-1.5L12 3Z"></path>
                          </svg>
                          <span id="calc-rarity-text">COMMON</span>
                        </span>
                      </div>

                      <p id="calc-result-slug"
                        class="mt-5 font-mono text-2xl font-bold tracking-wider text-neutral-900">AAA000</p>

                      <div class="mt-4 flex items-baseline gap-2">
                        <span id="calc-result-price" class="text-3xl font-bold text-neutral-900">0</span>
                        <span class="text-sm text-neutral-400">сум</span>
                      </div>
                      <div id="calc-similar-wrap"
                        class="mt-4 hidden rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 bg-neutral-50 px-3 py-2.5">
                        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-500">
                          Похожие свободные:
                          <span id="calc-similar-items" class="ml-1 inline-flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2"></span>
                        </p>
                      </div>

                      <p id="calc-result-formula" class="mt-2 font-mono text-xs text-neutral-400">100 000 x 1 x 1 = 100
                        000 сум</p>

                      <div class="mt-6 flex gap-6">
                        <div>
                          <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400">Буквы</p>
                          <p id="calc-letter-meta" class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-neutral-700">Обычные x1</p>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                          <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400">Цифры</p>
                          <p id="calc-digit-meta" class="mt-1 text-sm font-medium text-neutral-700">Обычные x1</p>
                        </div>
                      </div>

                      <a id="calc-reserve-link" href="#" data-order-link
                        class="interactive-btn btn-shimmer mt-8 inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-neutral-900 px-6 py-3 text-sm font-medium text-white transition-colors hover:bg-neutral-800">
                        Занять AAA000
                        <svg class="icon-stroke h-3.5 w-3.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
                          <path d="M5 12h14M13 5l7 7-7 7"></path>
                        </svg>
                      </a>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </section>





                <section id="home-profile-feed" class="px-6 py-16" data-observe-reveal>
                  <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">
                    <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-neutral-400">UNQ FEED</p>
